<section class="hero">
  <div class="container inner">
    <h1 class="statement reveal">
      Ship fast. Learn faster.<br />
      Build what lasts.
    </h1>

    <p class="sub reveal delay-1">
      Dalsicore is a solo Android studio in Indonesia. We've shipped over 20 apps, most of which
      never found an audience. Now we build AI-native products with Claude.
    </p>

    <div class="actions reveal delay-2">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/portfolio">See what we're building</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/archive">Read the archive</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    overflow: clip;
    padding-top: clamp(4rem, 9vw, 7rem);
    padding-bottom: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    background:
      radial-gradient(60% 80% at 85% 0%, rgba(217, 138, 134, 0.12), transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(50% 70% at 0% 10%, rgba(60, 86, 244, 0.08), transparent 55%);
  }

  .inner {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: start;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    max-width: 60rem;
  }

  .statement {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 7.2vw, 5.4rem);
    line-height: 1.02;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
    color: var(--text-0);
  }

  .sub {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 58ch;
    color: var(--text-1);
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.7vw, 1.3rem);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .actions {
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }
</style>
